{"id":"obvio","lemma":"obvio","pos":"adj","rank":1498,"glosses":["obvious","clear"],"ipa":"/ˈobbjo/","forms":{"feminine":"obvia","masculinePlural":"obvios","femininePlural":"obvias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-obvio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es obvio que no se interesa por nosotros.","en":"It's obvious that she doesn't care about us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693664","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to interest","l":"interesar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Era tan obvio.","en":"It was so obvious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443441","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"Estaba inquieto por razones obvias.","en":"I was concerned for obvious reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505903","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"restless"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"reason","l":"razón"},null]},{"text":"Es obvio que mi equipo va a ganar.","en":"It's obvious my team is going to win.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"team"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to gain"}]},{"text":"Este sistema tiene defectos obvios.","en":"This system has obvious defects.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"system"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"defect","l":"defecto"},null]}]}